{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38546","headline":"上巳日花下闲看 · 吴融","name":"上巳日花下闲看","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里香尘扑马飞，碧莲峰下踏青时。\n云鬟照水和花重，罗袖擡风惹絮迟。\n可便无心邀娬媚，还应有泪忆袁熙。\n如烟如梦争寻得，溪柳回头万万丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}